The '''Runic Pedestal''' allows the [[player]] to remove, apply, or upgrade [[Runes]]. It can be found inside the {{zone|Blacksmith}} at {{Coordinates|23|65|-134}}, next to {{NPCSprite|Dusk}}.

== Usage ==
The '''Runic Pedestal''' allows the [[player]] to fuse [[Runes]], add a [[Rune]] to an item, or remove a [[Rune]] from an item. The latter can be done by clicking the {{Item|Cauldron|text={{Yellow|Cauldron}}}} and placing the desired item in the slot. The Rune will be destroyed when removing it from an Item.

== Interface ==
{{/UI}}

== Trivia ==
*There was a glitch where the [[player]] could get an [[End Portal Frame]] by shift-clicking the "Combine Runes" button. This was later patched at an unknown date.

